msgstr "OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:10
#: 04638819453c4be1a312ec1a27198b3f 8d4dad20e03d4145aa66fab9a40f2c3f
#: e3e1287b309643d6b30092b6e6341234 f34b48390b11409b8cf74d0f731f07b3
#: f7a88c7050194cbfa00b8693db35929d
msgid ""
"OSD functionality is provided for on-board OSDs using MAX7456-type chips and"
" external MSP based OSDs, including DJI Goggles, and goggles using "
"DisplayPort. This enables overlay of FC data on the video. Once enabled, it "
"uses various panel items that can individually be set active and positioned "
"on the screen using respective parameters. It allows to setup multiple "
"screen layouts and switch between those using a spare RC channel. It also "
"allows the display and change of sets of parameters using stick gestures or "
"RC transmitters, in certain cases."
msgstr ""
"OSD 功能适用于使用 MAX7456 类型芯片的机载 OSD，以及基于 MSP 的外部 OSD（包括 DJI 头显和使用 DisplayPort "
"的头显）。这可实现飞控数据叠加在视频上。启用后，可使用各种面板项，并通过相应参数分别设置激活状态和屏幕位置。它允许设置多个屏幕布局，并使用备用 RC "
"通道在这些布局之间切换。在某些情况下，还允许通过摇杆手势或遥控器显示和更改参数组。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:15
#: 3eb812a2b0f54dd5955fb9b63febf493 a345a749fbf94d29851c027d6d874360
#: b7c5b5f014114e13ad3f42423007df24 b8a8c9f578924afab878988af1b96123
#: ea9fea83dd21404c88011eed65ed8c9f
msgid ""
"Being an integral library of ArduPilot firmware, the OSD code provides the "
"prerequisites to be redirected to various backends other than MAX-type "
"chipsets, including testing on SITL setups without actual autopilot- or "
"video-hardware needed."
msgstr ""
"作为 ArduPilot 固件的集成库，OSD 代码提供了将输出重定向到除 MAX 类型芯片组以外的各种后端的先决条件，包括在无需实际飞控或视频硬件的 "
"SITL 环境中进行测试。"

