#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:68
#: 1e06eec8f1ed4a609887489f576659e0 71a6f7687ed24a4a90b2742f42f0d9fb
#: 7dc970718403435d8e77f120c41dcf8a a47dd224c4124d428d7ad4aba3dc1a16
#: bd7fcb806f3e42ab854f82a8d26a0f51
msgid ""
"ArduPilot now supports having two OSD backends simultaneously. For example, "
"this would be used on long range planes where a shorter range HD system like"
" DJI or Walksnail would be used up until it reached the limit of its range, "
"and then the pilot would switch to using an analog, lower definition, longer"
" range system while operating at distance. In fact, it is possible to have "
"three OSD systems running simultaneously since pure MSP OSD telemetry is "
"active if any ONE OSD backend is running and an MSP base OSD could be "
"attached to a serial port using MSP protocol."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 现在支持同时使用两个 OSD 后端。例如，在长航程飞机上，可先使用 DJI 或 Walksnail "
"等短距离高清系统，直到达到其距离限制，然后切换到模拟低清晰度长距离系统进行远距离操作。实际上，由于纯 MSP OSD 数传在任意一个 OSD "
"后端运行时均处于激活状态，因此可以同时运行三个 OSD 系统，并通过 MSP 协议将基于 MSP 的 OSD 连接到串口。"

