msgid ""
"A typical configuration would be to use the onboard analog video OSD system,"
" together with a DisplayPort system. The setup would be:"
msgstr "典型配置是将机载模拟视频 OSD 系统与 DisplayPort 系统一起使用。设置方法如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:72
#: 33d7d77653a94a93b5397224a6a4c248 3f7ad232efe94b8093f6e433f6934396
#: 426847a882864143b956f1ed578e5955 963967da79eb4a67baae61a3a951bcf8
#: ca3fd42571974f04a6d2ace403fd5262
msgid ""
":ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 1 to enable the analog system, with a long range"
" video transmitter connected to the Video output pin of the autopilot"
msgstr ":ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 1 以启用模拟系统，将长距离图传连接到飞控的视频输出引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:73
#: 01dd994748374a1bae24d24577ef21b2 1d4d800f0d2f4bf08b9e46413c5b737d
#: 4eabe26f5b664329aceb571472a0fb8a 5be1629efd194529b87ee93c4226c85a
#: b2208a0e83e04d25961850e664697328
msgid ""
":ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5 to enable the second DisplayPort backend"
msgstr ":ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5 以启用第二个 DisplayPort 后端"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:74
#: 2578d4e1522048d6bc9420031ce056a2 39b780bc25f449cf8ca2134838a29b99
#: 6138bcc2820f4f2faeaebc77a96e2ad5 e421a4890a064936bc7cff13eb0f31d8
#: fb09280d20f64eb68bde360e68d5df2e
msgid ""
"``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 42 for the serial port which the DJI or Walksnail VTX"
" is connected for telemetry input to the goggles."
msgstr "``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 42，用于连接 DJI 或 Walksnail VTX 的串口，为头显提供数传输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:76
#: 0d24537c04304ae5a8f4a9b47e4add1e 0e51a5b11c3c432083e4073845e4aea3
#: 64a4f9aa42c9456d981274fb2c64bc62 b3f9e2ba8641457e881b7420431e66e8
#: db7814eb24264895a60a93d6e54e1027
msgid ""
"there are several combinations of first and second OSD type that are not "
"allowed and will result in a pre-arm warning to change configuration. The "
"most obvious is using two osd types of the same kind."
msgstr "有几种第一和第二 OSD 类型的组合不被允许，会导致预解锁警告要求更改配置。最明显的是使用两个相同类型的 OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:78
#: 160a46530cff45249853f5d2635e23e4 4a90b44c47cb4483b69a3f85561f2ff1
#: 54cc1ae425294b73942ebc2442f0fe9f b0779c59b65b4edab524cb7faa41052f
#: b692d3b04655428a9f560706f8baa29c
msgid ""
"although both OSD systems work simultaneously, if the two OSD systems are "
"different resolutions, you will need to setup multiple OSD screens (see "
"below) and switch the screen layout when switching to using the different "
"system (ie when  swapping the video display being actively used). It is "
"possible to create a single screen layout that works for both, but the "
"advantage of the HD system would be obviously reduced."
msgstr ""
"虽然两个 OSD 系统同时工作，但如果两个 OSD 系统分辨率不同，您需要设置多个 OSD "
"屏幕（见下文），并在切换使用不同系统时切换屏幕布局（即切换当前使用的视频显示）。虽然可以创建适用于两者的单一屏幕布局，但高清系统的优势显然会降低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:80
#: 021355782b604da088e0cf73085116e6 534d64f7bc49433480e3012d828081e3
#: 6790441275874a5ca849d499fe7137b8 b940849e345d4e64aab0243a0e3a5976
#: dadb955ef60a46dcb40f80c3133d78be
msgid ""
"screen item setup for HD displays may give warnings in Mission Planner about"
" screen location parameters being out of range. Just ignore those."
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中为高清显示器设置屏幕项目时，可能会出现关于屏幕位置参数超出范围的警告，忽略即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:85
#: 122e0123d24f4a06957ff6aab0d29caf 2b3e9ec1391d45b297936fd0cf37404a
#: 54a35c9e8eef40b78869f04d88b072d5 a56644b1407c4f009cbd68f0d69eeaf2
#: afba9d72d61d4ea6b5595862ab2f8923
msgid "Screens and screen switching"
msgstr "屏幕与屏幕切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:87
#: 211a4bc7950640c29726274fddb99357 50aa17fcb7be45678dac6d53915065a4
#: 77c403d6a0614aa984fb01cc8c2d1340 e37607146575431892e846a3a28f9d0a
#: f443876d04484cf598a1485a73dd9f23
msgid ""
"For multiple screen layouts, each parameter's \"OSD\" part is trailed by a "
"number, starting with \"1\" for the screen number for which the parameter "
"applies."
msgstr "对于多个屏幕布局，每个参数的 「OSD」 部分后跟一个数字，从 「1」 开始表示该参数适用的屏幕编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:89
#: 05337304d3ac458383fc76c5c0d41335 4fc82eb575734c04a2d00c70357594a2
#: 506ec21d01454fed92b46010bfcc9470 a89d0578529646c6ad3914f262ecaaee
#: c6fa40a101ea4429a5754e9c23c81450
msgid ""
"``OSDn_<ITEM>_<PARAMETER>`` - n represents the screen number, ITEM the "
"displayed data item, and PARAMETER, the enable and positions parameters for "
"this display item. OSD settings default to allowing up to 4 screens "
"available, each optionally enabled. Displayed data items can be shown on one"
" screen and not on others by setting its ENABLE parameter for that screen."
msgstr ""
"``OSDn_<ITEM>_<PARAMETER>`` — n 表示屏幕编号，ITEM 表示显示数据项，PARAMETER "
"表示该显示项的启用和位置参数。OSD 设置默认最多支持 4 "
"个屏幕，每个屏幕可选择性启用。显示数据项可在某一屏幕上显示而在其他屏幕上不显示，通过设置该屏幕的 ENABLE 参数实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:91
#: 1655b8260d934682832ce08824b3f65c 26fb74e0605d4b6ba83f610cae331fb9
#: 27dbdb5e99b6411aa8da644ce8f663af 2cd09be2b9174e00a0f7380877c773ce
#: 7519af85f31747208fac768899b18cf4
msgid ""
"Set parameters ``OSDn_CHAN_MIN`` and ``OSDn_CHAN_MAX`` are used to adjust RC"
" channel pwm limits to use for switching to a respective screen. Be careful "
"not to have overlapping PWM ranges for two screens."
msgstr ""
"设置参数 ``OSDn_CHAN_MIN`` 和 ``OSDn_CHAN_MAX`` 用于调整切换到相应屏幕的 RC 通道 PWM "
"限值。注意不要让两个屏幕的 PWM 范围重叠。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:93
#: 30b07aed7f9a41fa8cfbd625dbbaa40d 3e9d6ab0bbd944b786a34217e3c8ec1a
#: 6a5fb8442afb4d94932cb439bc7d9d71 b9579c2db43b4542b855369eeae20f45
#: cde7fd8990774415b8b28193b23fe0bb
msgid ""
"There are different switch-method options to meet individual RC systems "
"switch layout requirements. These can be set by parameter: "
":ref:`OSD_SW_METHOD<OSD_SW_METHOD>`. The options are:"
msgstr ""
"有不同的切换方法选项以满足各种 RC 系统开关布局的需求。可通过参数 :ref:`OSD_SW_METHOD<OSD_SW_METHOD>` "
"进行设置。选项如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:97
#: 205ee567b95a458eb5c4b89c54618e64 563d80f978ef49158bc713d6cce03751
#: 66518ad6adf444febf0b38850e8af40c 7da6abe7768d4e819d07f38ef3d712be
#: a4a3d5b8128b4f60a0e9fca60919256b
msgid ""
"0 = switches to next screen if the set RC channel's "
"(:ref:`OSD_CHAN<OSD_CHAN>`) value is changed"
msgstr "0 = 当设定 RC 通道（:ref:`OSD_CHAN<OSD_CHAN>`）的值改变时切换到下一个屏幕"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:98
#: 157479a332fa44668c7f6344f2eaed9d 28ad1dcf01064a1e8ac2e739aabfbae3
#: 37262a14d5e44312aa8e2edbb0ae0c7e be279445bb5a4474a74efecb01518efb
#: bf86dbd529954816ae9a3f91469efc10
msgid ""
"1 = directly selects a screen based on the set pwm limits for each "
"respective screen. RC channel value must change for new pwm value to be "
"recognized."
msgstr "1 = 根据每个屏幕设定的 PWM 限值直接选择屏幕。RC 通道值必须变化才能识别新的 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:99
#: 37183985931f4483b0b9769a4121dd5f 72e96a3eb3c54a17bb40f33729970538
#: 7b200adb039e47feb15e9d4f78b779b5 872f53f8d34d43cd83642a6d20ad4513
#: 97ca29804a6e44cbb7798e2c94408f0c
msgid ""
"2 = toggles screens on a low to high transition of set RC channel. keeps "
"toggling to next screen every 1s while channel value is kept high"
msgstr "2 = 在设定 RC 通道从低到高跳变时切换屏幕。在通道值保持高位期间，每 1 秒继续切换到下一个屏幕"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:104
#: 09adc82ad4064d74a46b63b8beabb4cc 3c8f218e130e4a25a09a7b816db7fb4f
#: 4724e56cfd724562b88c63daff3201f0 927f0364555842c48666b8bbbedf5a0c
#: d4a3ea7d65b54219bd34db4c1c8b695c
msgid "Panel items"
msgstr "面板项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:106
#: 66f7fcc9a41d4cb2800e01c7b612b5b1 769284f2251947399c1f84f802be8896
#: bfb6176814764b1e869087768ae86c65 f08108217f684518a0ed3b6dd0dedbb8
#: f2c3495f347148acb98a24158aecf3cd
msgid "Each OSD panel item uses a set of three variables to be set:"
msgstr "每个 OSD 面板项使用三个变量进行设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:108
#: 6516015ff63f4973b561b91c47ee26f2 af1b59663e674ab3b69a039fe2e4c9f0
#: bbf3876b643d4ce4881b0fe1877140c5 c15e0275084e4269b1b4f729d57ac062
#: ec35463a88e047f1bb4967a03f6e317f
msgid "``OSDn_<ITEM>EN`` - activates the respective item when set to 1."
msgstr "``OSDn_<ITEM>EN`` — 设置为 1 时激活相应项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:109
#: 50d948a703d244748f80eb8ec91add73 6541b0759f0647e3a4b5b4469bcc2b3e
#: 772dbda178ee4564abe0a826f8a3ff87 95bd52a5fa804f7db6359a7ed8e0b841
#: df781a5b1ce84247982837d7b7b3d298
msgid ""
"``OSDn_<ITEM>_X`` and ``OSDn_<ITEM>_Y`` set the horizontal and vertical "
"position of the item, starting with ``X = 0`` and ``Y = 0`` in the upper "
"left corner of your screen."
msgstr ""
"``OSDn_<ITEM>_X`` 和 ``OSDn_<ITEM>_Y`` 设置项目的水平和垂直位置，以屏幕左上角的 ``X = 0`` 和 ``Y ="
" 0`` 为起点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:113
#: 730401ca66db467d8f8478f0160ba258 8325ba3ad9a8453eb6245dbec1f236c7
#: 8fe613280ec6434494abbf825b177c6c ce87560d8cb7428fb2311598c389369c
#: d1e5487bed914d4793857635b17445b7
msgid ""
"The typical MAXChip based OSD screen has a visible matrix of 30 horizontal x"
" 13 vertical chars in NTSC standard, while PAL standard has 16 vertical "
"chars. The OSD code enables auto-detection of NTSC vs. PAL to match input "
"signal properties."
msgstr ""
"典型的基于 MAXChip 的 OSD 屏幕在 NTSC 标准下可见矩阵为 30 列 x 13 行字符，PAL 标准则为 16 行。OSD "
"代码支持自动检测 NTSC 与 PAL 以匹配输入信号特性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:115
#: 143ecc9ad31441c388aec651b2c99b3a 205f825d53854f1496467a63bc1676e5
#: 216720b43bcb4cd292e3f5e2fa19233c bb6195bea6a84cac8cdddf22351bcfca
#: d1eaaaae772441bca7935082652c168a
msgid ""
"ArduPilot calculates an sensor-less airspeed estimate that is used if no "
"sensor is present or fails. :ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` must be set to "
"zero in order to display this value as the airspeed item, if no sensor is "
"present."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 计算一个无传感器的空速估算值，在无传感器或传感器故障时使用。若无传感器，:ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` "
"必须设置为零，才能将此值作为空速项显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:118
#: 1097c516cdef4ed2b31f3e93f27fb6df 8f00bab9a1824044a7c48f12d3950cbc
#: a7f515ecf3204b23986bda861bee447b e6a7f03f95b346f6983de91ddb2803ff
#: ec0dd047ce004ab1af7e426c09e973b9
msgid "Displaying statistics on a dedicated screen"
msgstr "在专用屏幕上显示统计信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:119
#: 274c9c0f13b2477b96199b0c30e782c5 391382ed68b9417b981978c2ca003097
#: 6950b6ceb2f64de9b3cf5beba3651ffc ab42d6b7616949f59fc7529b38b6e261
#: f64e54e966174804bb7b12f00cb631d3
msgid ""
"Displaying statistics on a dedicated screen requires enabling at least one "
"extra screen by setting the respective ``OSDn_ENABLE`` to 1. By default, "
"ArduPilot has only one screen active so in a typical setup one would set "
"(:ref:`OSD2_ENABLE<OSD2_ENABLE>`) = 1 and then enabling the OSD stats panel "
"on screen 2 by setting (:ref:`OSD2_STATS_EN<OSD2_STATS_EN>`) = 1."
msgstr ""
"在专用屏幕上显示统计数据需要通过将相应的 ``OSDn_ENABLE`` 设置为 1 来启用至少一个额外屏幕。默认情况下，ArduPilot "
"只有一个屏幕处于激活状态，因此在典型设置中，应将（:ref:`OSD2_ENABLE<OSD2_ENABLE>`）= "
"1，然后通过将（:ref:`OSD2_STATS_EN<OSD2_STATS_EN>`）= 1 在屏幕 2 上启用 OSD 统计面板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:122
#: 2443f381fd9b43cf9775a8349faefae0 482e2363b676498f9627604bca59b954
#: 6dd8b3acb6f846c28a1cc166945d1765 700430ba44ce4b2bbd4a5a26b9fe43d7
#: f0f171aa9d44496582efb9727f4b0394
msgid ""
"When the OSD switches to this screen it will check the value of the "
":ref:`OSD2_STATS_EN<OSD2_STATS_EN>` parameter and if enabled it will "
"override the default behavior of the following OSD items:"
msgstr ""
"当 OSD 切换到该屏幕时，它将检查 :ref:`OSD2_STATS_EN<OSD2_STATS_EN>` 参数的值，如果启用，它将覆盖以下 OSD "
"项的默认行为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:124
#: 05afde26bfa843d3b7d8cf90f6999ce6 07f07fb971494350bbafd720484d8150
#: 4d4ed66246854083a721fc2a3d639a6b 65844eb255d543be88424957713e66e8
#: 7c955671e13a48bf90e17facf60044c8
msgid "OSDn_MESSAGE will display STATS followed by flight time"
msgstr "OSDn_MESSAGE 将显示 STATS，后跟飞行时间"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:125
#: 41bf5c1cf98243e39a031b2fd75f2e76 61ddb353e2a9442ab55ad5086ac437e8
#: 78ebb23559be4241aacb033b3167e689 7cc5bea732a844a3b2f0957eaa3a2636
#: eb64e417adf94ba0acced8061ee35b60
