"OSDn_HOMEDIST will alternates max distance from home and total traveled "
"distance every 2 seconds"
msgstr "OSDn_HOMEDIST 每 2 秒交替显示距 Home 的最大距离和总飞行距离"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:130
#: 24b8adad87a44ddfaa7e91ccf7f3cb69 27ba6a67b1034503bf971d276962080c
#: cd683653eff249789d526b0530b06084 f908e1fa741642a19a166d195b517378
#: febd671568334507bdbc672aef6099c3
msgid "OSDn_RSSI will display min rssi"
msgstr "OSDn_RSSI 将显示最低 RSSI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:134
#: 49863de6c6d84c23936f1869e479e39d 7eee84acf8384f9ebd2b2497b5935926
#: a6185be573d74ed18be225c0986b9292 b487933656dd4e95bcf9bbc3cfefd4d3
#: cae6bb52e59845a7b69984df02813395
msgid "Callsign panel"
msgstr "呼号面板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:136
#: 2fc06f004c2d432893c815d40030329a 72c5b7798bb4457ba1cd1060514f5a47
#: 7e79ecb0060f4f45b53812d179b50467 b0260333426447b2a974a8a4238fc202
#: eb8a92ba7c3743caa70a5cbe931297c7
msgid ""
"This panel allows to display your amateur radio callsign (or any other "
"individual character string) on your onboard OSD screen. It will read the "
"character string from a file named \"callsign.txt\" placed in the root of "
"your SD card. Mind that the default ardupilot charsets require to use "
"capital letters for correct display. Using MAVftp is a convenient option to "
"upload the file to your SD card without having to physically remove it from "
"your flightcontroller."
msgstr ""
"此面板允许在机载 OSD 屏幕上显示您的业余无线电呼号（或任何其他自定义字符串）。它将从 SD 卡根目录下名为 「callsign.txt」 "
"的文件中读取字符串。请注意，默认的 ArduPilot 字符集需要使用大写字母才能正确显示。使用 MAVftp 是将文件上传到 SD "
"卡的便捷方式，无需物理取出飞控中的 SD 卡。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:139
#: 0ae947e8cf794f1ea7d74ad62bac05a7 28481399d04d4ac39a6ed79acf92510a
#: 7a729afbd0834137ba09a53af547a58e 8aa705b9080a40fdbe62c227f2d85822
#: 93297172047b44bdb009c39c5ff243fb
msgid "User Programmable Warnings"
msgstr "用户可编程警告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:140
#: 3a4fafc71fba4a7184de26f866faeea3 603e136c90cb4e31bd1ec9201af98e01
#: 9748a8485a944ec49ef0173ac11c2e56 b151002e7a0849ef9c8a6d82204be657
#: c48c9a301e1346d58d605362cb2cdd96
msgid ""
"Several user defined warnings can be set which will flash the respective osd"
" panel item when warning level is reached or exceeded"
msgstr "可以设置多个用户自定义警告，当达到或超过警告级别时，相应的 OSD 面板项将闪烁"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-overview.rst:142
#: 284d4717fbb24048a88d3e5701dde44b a058265e1be6422bba6d831145810111
#: ad425305e0b64e30a962e44ab944f0dc f5c2c27968c441c58037e75f8e3f2cf5
#: f5d4a0a1432b4399a8ee6c84f17dfde1
msgid ""
":ref:`OSD_W_BATVOLT<OSD_W_BATVOLT>` - Blinks battery voltage panel if less "
